00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:34.670
<v Ira Glass>Elia could drag himself around. But it was pretty rough going. He was sicker than he had ever been in his life, he said. One other detail-- Elia has a history of asthma, so he's at elevated risk. He'd also developed GI symptoms, throwing up, a possible warning sign that a COVID patient is in more danger.
<v Ira Glass>埃利亚可以勉强走动。但情况相当糟糕。他说这是他一生中最严重的疾病。还有一个细节——埃利亚有哮喘病史，所以他属于高危人群。他还出现了胃肠道症状，呕吐，这可能是新冠患者面临更大危险的警告信号。

