00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:16.860
<v Elia Einhorn>I haven't seen Amy in like a week. Amy has just been in our room the whole time. So since there's one bathroom, she comes out to use the bathroom. And otherwise, like, I just don't see her.
<v Elia Einhorn>我大概有一个星期没见过艾米了。艾米一直待在我们的房间里。因为只有一个浴室，她出来用一下。除此之外，就像我根本见不到她一样。

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:29.790
<v Elia Einhorn>And we usually talk for like one or two minutes. But yeah, Amy is just in our room. And she's really, really sick. Her fever goes up and down and up and down. And just when we think it's gone, it comes back worse, and it's--
<v Elia Einhorn>我们通常谈话也就一两分钟。但是的，艾米就待在我们的房间里。她病得很重。她的发烧反反复复。刚以为退烧了，又变严重了，而且——

