00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:53.540
<v Ben Calhoun>And I can imagine that, as a parent, you're just like-- you're having all these needs that are unmet right now. And right now, you're having a need that I can meet. So let me just throw whatever I can in there.
<v Ben Calhoun>我能想象作为父母，你就是——你现在有很多未被满足的需求。而现在，你有一个我可以满足的需求。所以让我尽可能地满足她吧。

00:13:53.540 --> 00:14:00.880
<v Elia Einhorn>Exactly, exactly. I looked-- I looked at us. We were reading one of those Mo Willems books, you know that like--
<v Elia Einhorn>没错，没错。我看着——看着我们。我们正在读那些莫·威廉姆斯（Mo Willems）的书，你知道那个——

