<v Elia Einhorn>Me and the two and a half year old look terrible. And I'm wearing my mask, you know, because there's this theory about the viral load getting bigger, you know I mean? With more exposure.
<v Elia Einhorn>我和两岁半的孩子看起来糟透了。我戴着口罩，你知道吗，因为有一种理论说病毒载量会变大，你懂我的意思吗？随着接触次数增加。

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:48.910
<v Elia Einhorn>So just to give you sort of a scene report here, it looks like-- think about a normal Brooklyn-sized apartment. It looks like there was 50 toddlers who had an unsupervised birthday party here. So like, from my vantage point on the couch, I'm looking out.
