00:14:48.910 --> 00:15:09.180
<v Elia Einhorn>The first layer is like a peg's game, where you push buttons into colors. The second layer is all these 3x2 foot huge Paw Patrol pages to color. The next level is a farm that seems to have exploded. The next level are all the Play-Dohs strewn around the ground because I just can't pick it up.
<v Elia Einhorn>第一层是类似拼图游戏，把按钮按进颜色里。第二层是所有这些 3x2 英尺巨大的汪汪队（Paw Patrol）涂色纸。下一层是一个看起来好像爆炸了的农场。再下一层是散落在地上的所有橡皮泥，因为我实在捡不动了。

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:18.870
<v Ben Calhoun>Do you have all your logistics covered like groceries? How you doing groceries? How are you like-- I don't know, like laundry.
