00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:19.220
<v Ben   Calhoun>Do you feel like you've-- I feel like, if I were you, I would keep waiting to feel, like, bottomed out-- be like, is this-- is this the bottom? Is this the bottom?
<v Ben   Calhoun>你有没有觉得你一直在等那种触底的感觉——就像在想，这是不是底了？这是不是底了？

