00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:44.660
<v Elia  Einhorn>And it's like, on the one hand, I mean, we have food. We have water. We have electricity. I mean, we have everything we need.
<v Elia  Einhorn>一方面，我的意思是，我们有食物。我们有水。我们有电。我的意思是，我们有需要的一切。

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:56.080
<v Elia  Einhorn>If this is all that ever happens, it'll be a triumph. It seriously will if this is all that happens. It's just the scariest part is, is it going to go into our lungs, you know?
<v Elia  Einhorn>如果这就是所能发生的一切，那将是一个胜利。如果这就是全部后果，那真的是个胜利。最可怕的是，它会进入我们的肺部吗，你知道？

