00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:32.890
<v Elia Einhorn>You're getting the ugly cry. I've only let myself cry about it a little bit.
<v Elia Einhorn>你快要哭得丑死了。我只允许自己为它哭了一点点。

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:39.950
<v Ben Calhoun>I wish I could do something for you guys.
