<v Elia  Einhorn>[LAUGHS]
<v Elia  Einhorn>[笑声]

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:59.210
<v Ben  Calhoun>Should we have the kids FaceTime tonight? Would that-- would that be helpful?
<v Ben  Calhoun>我们要不要让孩子们今晚 FaceTime？那样——那样会有帮助吗？

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:07.600
<v Elia Einhorn>Yeah, that would be, just for her and for me to just sit down for a minute, honestly. It's like one of the only times I can rest when she's awake.
<v Elia Einhorn>是的，那会很有用，只是为了她，也为了我能坐下休息一会，老实说。这真的是她醒着时我唯一能休息的时候。

00:22:07.600 --> 00:22:14.270
<v Ben Calhoun>We can do more of that, too, like if the kids can keep her occupied on FaceTime.
<v Ben Calhoun>我们可以做更多那样的事，比如如果孩子们能在 FaceTime 上分散她的注意力。

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:18.820
<v Elia Einhorn>Oh, man. Honestly, you guys are great.
<v Elia Einhorn>噢，伙计。老实说，你们太棒了。

