<v Elia Einhorn>Now she's waking up. That's the peril of making any noise in this environment. But hopefully, she'll go back to sleep. You guys have been amazing. Just FaceTiming with your kids has been amazing. Yeah, we're just going to have to ride it the fuck out.
<v Elia Einhorn>现在她醒了。这就是在这个环境中发出任何声音的代价。但希望她能回去睡觉。你们太棒了。光是和你们的孩子 FaceTime 就太棒了。是的，我们只能硬撑下去了。

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:54.680
<v Ira  Glass>Elia Einhorn with Ben Calhoun, who's a producer on our show. That was recorded a little over a week ago. At this point today, Amy is much better. She's actually up and around.
<v Ira  Glass>埃利亚·艾因霍恩与我们节目的制作人本·卡尔霍恩的对话。那是大约一周前录制的。今天此时此刻，艾米的情况好多了。她实际上已经能下床走动了。

00:22:54.680 --> 00:23:39.000
<v Ira  Glass>Elia got a lot worse after that call. But now he's also feeling better. Conwy is presumed to have had a mild case of the virus. She's doing fine.
<v Ira  Glass>埃利亚在那次通话后病情严重了很多。但现在他也感觉好多了。康威被认为患有轻度病毒感染。她很好。

